// Hosted zones, their record sets, and private zones' VPC attachments.
//
// A hosted zone is a domain the platform answers for. A public zone answers
// on the internet, from the platform's name servers, once it has proved
// control of its name and is delegated to them. A private zone answers only
// inside the VPCs it is attached to. A record set is every record of one
// name and type in a zone: a list of values, or an alias that follows a
// platform resource's address.
//
